  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\n\nThe newly implemented Native UI is constantly forcing your Phone / Tablet in Portrait Mode.\n\nThis is especially annoying on Andorid Tablets.\n\n# Expected Behaviour:\n\nThe Native UI should not force a specifc device orientation, just like the client it self doesn't.\n\n(and yes, the Native UI works in Landscape, it *sometimes* allows you to use it)",
